fcft is a small font loading and glyph rasterization library built on fontconfig and
freetype, used by foot. Built without HarfBuzz text shaping and docs, with its bundled
SVG glyph support. Installs libfcft, headers and fcft.pc under /usr/local.
upstream: https://codeberg.org/dnkl/fcft
